window.products.push({"id":159077,"name":"BLACK+DECKER BPWM20W 2.0 cu.ft. Portable Washer, Cu. Ft, White & BCED26 Portable Dryer, Small, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I0uuH3UuL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Product 1: SMALL PORTABLE WASHING MACHINE – Ideal for camping trips and for your RV, apartment, boat or dorm, our clothes washer is compact but powerful. Its portability and lightweight design make it practical and easily stored or moved in small spaces. It measures 21.6 x 22.2 x 37.4 inches (WxDxH), and connects to your kitchen faucet with the INCLUDED drain hose and quick-connect sink adapter. Product 1: CONVENIENT DESIGN & LARGE CAPACITY - With a 2.0 cubic feet tub that washes up to 15 pounds of laundry in 15-59 minutes depending on the cycle, this top loading portable washer machine has an easy to use LED digital display panel and a transparent top viewing window. It has a pause button, and an auto shutoff safety function if the washer is opened during the cycle. Product 1: 6 CYCLE PROGRAMS & 3 WATER SETTINGS – Accommodate your specific laundry needs with Normal, Heavy, Delicate, Quick, Bulky, and Spin Only cycles. Control the times and combination of Soak, Wash, Rinse, and Spin cycles with the push of a button. You can also adjust the water level based on load size by selecting High, Medium, or Low. Product 1: ENERGY EFFICIENT OPERATION – This compact washing machine is only for use with cold water. It has a built in lint-filter that does not need to be replaced and only needs to be cleaned about once a month. It’s designed for high efficiency (HE) liquid or powder detergent or (HE) detergent sheets only. Product 2: FITS ANYWHERE: This portable dryer (23.6” x 17.1” x 27.5”) is ideal for apartments, dorm rooms, & campers. At 48.4 lbs., this clothes dryer is powerful with a load volume of 8.8 lbs. & inside capacity of 2.65 cu. ft. Product 2: CHOOSE YOUR MODE: Pick from 4 different drying modes to best suit your needs: Air Dry, Cool, Warm & Hot. This transportable clothes dryer possesses 1400W of drying power as well as overheat protection. Product 2: IMPRESSIVE SPECS: Our portable dryer comes with a 4” diameter vent hose & exhaust connector, lint & exhaust filters. At 120V, this clothes dryer has a durable stainless steel drum and front loading transparent lid. Product 2: HASSLE-FREE OPERATION: Drying times with this outstanding portable dryer vary from 30 minutes to 200 minutes. No inconvenience, no hassle—efficiently drying clothes has never been easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41I0uuH3UuL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK+DECKER","source_asin":"B094KK21HX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-159077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094KK21HX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B094KK21HX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
