window.products.push({"id":159139,"name":"Standard Refrigerator Conversion Kit (US Sankey Coupler - No CO2 Tank)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rGUh6va7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Conversion Kits are the simplest way to convert a spare refrigerator into an home dispensing beer system. Also save money on beer! Draft beer is 1/2 the cost of cans or bottles. Ideal for your kitchen, patio, home brew or custom installations. This kit is used for dispensing most domestic beers. Does not include air tank. Video: Turn Your Fridge into a Kegerator! Learn How Click to download installation instructions. In stock and ready to ship. Features: Allows for dispensing domestic beers. Comes with everything you need to convert a refrigerator. Includes: US Sankey keg coupler. Double gauge CO2 regulator. Chrome faucet head. Faucet knob. 5\" shank. 5' beer line with connectors. 5' air line with clamps. Washers. Tap Soother faucet cap. Detailed instructions. *THIS KIT DOES NOT INCLUDE AIR TANK*.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rGUh6va7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KegWorks®","source_asin":"B0006SS09O","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-159139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006SS09O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006SS09O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
