window.products.push({"id":159546,"name":"Davivy 34 inch Gas Cooktop,5 Burner Gas Stove Top,Built in Stainless Steel Gas Cooktop - NG/LPG Convertible,Dual Fuel,Thermocouple Protection,Easy to ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kj1tZPUmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★【5 High Efficiency Burner & Product Dimension】This 34 inch built-in gas cooktop has 5 high -efficiency sealed burners:Auxiliary Burner 3413 BTU;Semi-rapid burner 5972 BTU *2; Rapid burner 9385 BTU;Triple ring burner 11262 BTU.They will distribute even heat for simmer, boil, stir-frying, steaming, melting or others, it is very suitable for daily use at home and can meet the needs of different cooking temperatures.Product size: 34'' x 20'' x 3.95'', built-in size: 33'' x 18.9''. ★【NG/LPG Convertible & Easy to Operate】This dual fuel gas stovetop is designed for natural gas and liquid propane.Natural gas nozzles are preset and can be replaced with LPG nozzles to meet your different needs. Automatic ignition via rotating control, flexible and accurate gas adjustment.It is 110V~120V AC pulse ignition system and no battery required.Multi-dimensional air nozzle, direct injection with constant pressure, effective combustion, reduce combustion exhaust gas. ★【Brushed Stainless Steel Finish & Durable Quality】The surface of our gas cooktop is composed of brushed 304 Stainless Steel Finish, which is fashionable and atmospheric, wear-resistant and scratch-resistant. When the oil splashes on the panel, just wipe with a rag and minimal cleaning can be enjoyed. High temperature and rust resistant heavy duty cast iron grates make your stove burner more stable.Durable, melt-resistant metal knobs control the burners individually to cook more food in less time. ★【Thermocouple Protection & Easy Maintenance】This 34 inch gas cooktop with flameout features the latest thermocouple protection safety devices,each burner ensures that the gas is automatically shut off when no flame is detected, avoiding gas leaks and keeping your home and family safe.5 sealed burners prevent food from falling into them. You can simply remove the grate and wipe it clean with water or detergent. ★【100% Satisfied Customers Service】Each gas cooktop is rigorously factory tested and is certified by CSA to ensure 100% safety.We provide 2 years warranty and free lifetime customer service,customer satisfaction is our responsibility. Please refer to the instruction manual before use, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will solve it for you in time, please don't worry about it.Thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Kj1tZPUmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Davivy","source_asin":"B0B9BLPJ63","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-159546","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BLPJ63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BLPJ63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
