window.products.push({"id":159560,"name":"Fisher Paykel E522BLE4 17.6 cu. ft. Capacity Left Hinge Counter Depth Bottom Freezer Refrigerator in White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21AYpyT46hL._AC_.jpg","description":"Easy Living These fridges adapt to suit your lifestyle by streamlining food preparation and organisation with SmartTouch controls flexible shelving and storage options and slide out bins and trays.Sized to Suit Available in multiple widths these fridges are sized to suit families and kitchens large and small. Designed to fit easily in your kitchen they can sit flush with your bench top with a range of ultra flat or curved doors. Concealed hinges on many models add to a clean refined appearance.Easy Cleaning Removable spill safe glass shelves are easy to clean and contain drips and spills. Storage bins and EZKleen stainless steel doors just need a wipe to keep spotless.Efficient ActiveSmart fridges intelligently adapt to daily use to save energy cooling defrosting and using energy only when they need to without compromising on foodcare.What is ActiveSmart?ActiveSmart consists of a microprocessor interior temperature sensors independently controlled variable speed fans and multiple air ducts. The microprocessor controls how the refrigerator operates based on changing patterns of use. The sensors continuously send information to the microprocessor which analyses and adjusts the fan speed and compressor operations accordingly to deliver a consistent and stable temperature. Continuous feedback means that ActiveSmart adjusts to the way you live. Its ability to respond to daily use means that it only uses the energy needed to keep your food fresher for longer.How ActiveSmart helps you. Independent Control = Better Food Care The Humidity Control System together with the cool and consistent temperature delivered by ActiveSmart Technology creates the perfect microclimate for your produce. Greater Intelligence = Greater Efficiency Sensors constantly record changes to fridge and freezer compartments including when the doors are opened and when new items are introduced ensuring temperature in each compartment is kept constant. Rapid Chilling = Optimised Food Pres","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21AYpyT46hL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fisher & Paykel","source_asin":"B00E1TGO24","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-159560","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E1TGO24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E1TGO24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
