window.products.push({"id":159678,"name":"2pcs WP37001298 Dryer Drum Front Glide Kit Fits for Whirlpool Maytag Amana Dryers Replaces 37001298 PS2039613 40116501","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.58,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mHH6wy5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2pcs WP37001298 Dryer Drum Front Glide Kit Fits for Whirlpool Maytag Amana Dryers Replaces 37001298 PS2039613 40116501 Product Description: Part Number:WP37001298 Dryer Drum Glide. It is also known as a drum slide, glide, pad, drum front glide.  Function: The dryer drum glide supports the drum on the front side and allows the drum to move smoothly.  Applicable Brands: For Whirlpool, Amana, Maytag, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Speed Queen, Crosley, Roper, Admiral, Hardwick, Jenn-Air, Estate, Magic Chef,Inglis, Norge, Modern Maid, Caloric & Ikea.  Repair Symptoms: Noisy, will not tumble, will leave traces on clothes, unusual noise, no heat, not enough heat, too long drying time, will not start.  Replaces Part Number: AP6008790, 37001298, 40116501, 40116502, 5-1553, 501553, 501676, 503452, WP37001298VP, Y501676 Specifications: Material:ABS Color:Yellow Size:7.9x1.3x0.3cm/3.11x0.51x0.12inch(LxWxH) Dryer Drum Glide Top Parts Width 5.5mm/0.22inch Package Include: 2 x Dryer Drum Glide Please Note: 1.The drum glide is installed on the front bulkhead either at the top or the bottom, regardless of the brand of dryer. 2.To gain access to the drum glide, you will have to open the cabinet on the dryer. 3.One thing to note about the drum slides is that they should be replaced in pairs. 4.Before beginning this repair, it is important to disconnect the dryer from the power source.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mHH6wy5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"savone","source_asin":"B09KC2DF8J","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-159678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KC2DF8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KC2DF8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
