window.products.push({"id":159731,"name":"Reusable Capsules for Nespresso OriginalLine - 6pcs Espresso Refillable Pods Stainless Steel Coffee Pods Compatible for Nespresso Originaline Machine(","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DubcSj-wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reusable Capsules Coffee Refillable Pods Description:Reusable espresso pod is made of food-grade stainless steel, can be washed and used repeatedly,save your money.Our delicate and premium bamboo tray with 6 Capsules holders and 1 lid holder allows you to prefill and store 6 refillable pods at once，keep your pre-filled coffee fresh for 7 days! Get ready to use anytime.It is a perfect substitute for plastic capsules,reduce plastic wastes and protects the environment, keep your health.Package included:6 x Stainless Steel Capsules Coffee Pods100 x Aluminum Foil Lids1 x bamboo tray1 x Spoon1 x BrushHow to Use the Reusable Coffee Capsules:Step 1: Fill the coffee box with your favorite coffee abrasive.Step 2: Press with the bottom side of the scoop,clean excess grinds using the scoop’s handle.Step 3: Seal the capsule with the foil sticker lid.Step 4: put into machine,brew and enjoy your coffee.Usage Tips:Some customers meet the coffee is tasteless,no water out from machine or just less water when use the capsule pod,maybe here is the reasons:1.Coffee powder you use is too fine,put too much powder,too tight of the powder you press.2. The the filter net or the water outlet is blocked.Please take pod out and adjust.3.The capsule is not compatible with the machine.(Order it before confirm your coffee machine if Compatible for or not!)Compatible with Most Nespresso OriginalLine Machine:Compatible with Inissia C40, Inissia D40, F111 Lattissima One, Lattissima Pro F456, CitiZ& Milk C122, CitiZ C112, CitiZ D112,Expert C80, Creatista Plus,Expert& Milk C85, Pixie C60, Pixie C60P, Pixie Clips, Essenza Mini C30.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DubcSj-wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZOCOVHI","source_asin":"B0BYRZ4D5P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-159731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYRZ4D5P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYRZ4D5P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
