window.products.push({"id":159878,"name":"Cooksir 2 Burner Electric Cooktop - 12 Inch Electric Stove Top Bulit-in & Countertop 3000W, Double Burner Ceramic Cooktop with Glass Protection, Child","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ud0OjC0nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2 Burner Electric Stovetop 220-240V】Please note that the voltage of this double burner stove is 220-240V, it is hardwired without a plug, and cannot be directly connected to the outlet. The 12 inch electric cooktop is equipped with two powerful burners(1800+1200W) with independent control, and they can cook at the same time to help you save time on cooking. Note: Ceramic cooktop does not always show red during heating, which is a normal phenomenon rather than a fault. 【Countertop & Built-in Electric Cooktop】Cooksir electric cooktop 12 inch can be installed in two ways, embedded or countertop, designed according to the overall style of the kitchen. Embedded design has a modern decoration style, beautiful and elegant. The countertop mounting method eliminates the cost of cutting holes and makes it easier to move the stovetop in small range during cleaning the kitchen. Remember to install the four foot in the package to the back. 【Multi-functional Electric Cooktop】12'' electric stovetop has a control area with digital display and clear function icons. It adopts the slide-control design, slide your finger left or right on the sensor bar to decrease or increase the number, which is easy to adjust the power and time. The electric stove has several safety protection functions, such as child safety lock (\"LO\"), residual heat indicator (\"H\"), over temperature protection, 0-99 minutes timer and pause function (shows \"||\"). 【Full Metal Frame, Black Crystal Glass】Full metal frame for protection glass from bumps, to avoid cracks due to collisions affecting the life of the electric cooktop. Black crystal panel make the 12'' electric cooktop look neat and elegant, and it is easy to clean. You can remove stains by wiping with a damp cloth and soapy water. A scraper is included in the package as an auxiliary tool, please pay attention to its sharp blade. Always wait for the temperature to drop before you start cleaning. 【Suitable for All Kinds of Cookwares】12 inch electric ceramic hob is suitable for all kinds of cookwares, such as stainless steel pan, copper pot, glass pot, casserole. You just need to make sure the bottom of them is flat. Check that there is no water on the bottom of the pan and the stove top before putting the pan on, otherwise it will easily leave marks on the stove top when it heats up. 【Product Size】20.47x11.41x1.73in (520x290x44mm) Cut-out Size: 19.29x10.63in (490x270mm)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ud0OjC0nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooksir","source_asin":"B0C2CVCZT3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-159878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CVCZT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CVCZT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
